+````markdown name=ops/hsm/hsm_activation_checklist_gcp.md
+```text
+GCP KMS Activation Checklist (Operator)
+
+Preconditions:
+ - Operator has project owner/crypto admin rights or delegated service account.
+ - Vault is reachable and operator can write to it.
+
+Steps:
+1) Create key ring:
+   gcloud kms keyrings create aegis-keyring --location=<region> --project=<project>
+
+2) Create asymmetric key:
+   gcloud kms keys create aegis-cosign --location=<region> --keyring=aegis-keyring --purpose=asymmetric-signing --default-algorithm=rsa-sign-pkcs1-3072-sha256
+
+3) Grant signer role to service account:
+   gcloud kms keys add-iam-policy-binding aegis-cosign --location=<region> --keyring=aegis-keyring --member=serviceAccount:signer@<project>.iam.gserviceaccount.com --role=roles/cloudkms.signerVerifier
+
+4) Record key resource id and store in Vault staging:
+   vault kv put secret/data/aegis/kms/staging cosign_key_refs="gcpkms://projects/<project>/locations/<region>/keyRings/aegis-keyring/cryptoKeys/aegis-cosign"
+
+5) Auditor review, then promote to active in Vault.
+
+6) Smoke-test cosign:
+   cosign sign --key gcpkms://projects/<project>/locations/<region>/keyRings/aegis-keyring/cryptoKeys/aegis-cosign artifact.tar.gz
+   cosign verify --key gcpkms://... artifact.tar.gz
+
+Rotation:
+ - Create new key version or new key; repeat issuance manifest and re-sign flow.
+
