+````markdown name=ops/hsm/hsm_activation_checklist_azure.md
+```text
+Azure Key Vault HSM Activation Checklist (Operator)
+
+Preconditions:
+ - Operator has owner privileges in subscription or Key Vault access.
+ - Vault CLI configured and access to Azure Key Vault Premium tier (HSM).
+
+Steps:
+1) Create Key Vault (HSM-backed):
+   az keyvault create --name aegis-kv --resource-group <rg> --location <loc> --sku premium
+
+2) Create HSM-protected key:
+   az keyvault key create --vault-name aegis-kv --name aegis-cosign --protection hsm --size 3072 --kty RSA
+
+3) Assign access policy to signer managed identity (e.g., vm or service principal):
+   az keyvault set-policy -n aegis-kv --object-id <principal-id> --key-permissions sign get
+
+4) Record key id and add to Vault staging:
+   vault kv put secret/data/aegis/kms/staging cosign_key_refs="<https://aegis-kv.vault.azure.net/keys/aegis-cosign/<version>>"
+
+5) Auditor review → promote staging → perform cosign smoke test:
+   cosign sign --key azurekms://<key-id> artifact.tar.gz
+
+Rotation:
+ - Generate new key version, follow issuance manifest flow and re-sign artifacts.
+
